// AUDIT FIX (sitewide comparison-matrix dedupe): this page previously
// dropped indices 1 and 3, which was byte-for-byte identical to Vadodara
// (also drops indices 1 and 3) - the prior comment's uniqueness claim was
// wrong because it was never checked against Vadodara. Thane now drops
// indices 0, 2, and 3 (keeping rows 1, 4, and 5), which is a combination no
// other page uses. Vadodara keeps the original two-index drop (indices 1
// and 3) unchanged as the first-built page in this pair. See also Rajkot
// (rows 0-4), Vizag (rows 1-5), Bangalore (full library), Pune (drops index
// 3), Kolkata (drops index 1), Chennai (now drops indices 0, 1, and 5),
// Hyderabad (drops index 2), and Chandigarh/Gurgaon/Mumbai/Nagpur (the
// former single-index-4 group, now Chandigarh keeps index 4 alone while
// Gurgaon/Mumbai/Nagpur each use a distinct triple drop).
const thaneComparisonRows = BOFU_COMPARISON_LIBRARY.filter(
