<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Thane</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Thane
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career counselling in Thane
        <span class="gold-text"> for the commute-to-Mumbai-or-stay-local decision</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Thane runs its own civic and economic life through the Thane Municipal Corporation, a City-of-Lakes identity, and a growing Wagle Estate-to-Kolshet Road IT and office corridor sitting alongside its older Thane-Belapur pharma and chemical manufacturing belt - it is not simply a line item inside Mumbai's suburbs.
        For a large share of Thane's working population, the sharpest real decision is whether to keep commuting two to three hours a day into Mumbai for stronger pay, or build a career inside Thane's own economy instead - and getting that decision right, with a clear-eyed view of the high-value skill portfolio that keeps unlocking high income opportunities on either path, matters more than which city label the job carries.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is delivered fully online in Thane and across India. You can start from home, campus, or work, wherever you already are - no travel, no waiting for local availability.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        The stronger filter is not only whether the search started with Thane. It is whether the guidance understands Thane's own economy well enough to help you judge the Mumbai-commute-versus-local-job trade-off honestly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

