    sectionId="thane-economy"
    title="Thane has its own civic and economic identity, distinct from Mumbai's"
    subtitle="A useful page for this city has to speak to Thane's own municipal, lake-city, industrial, and cultural character - not treat it as a Mumbai footnote."
